      authorEn: 'Epictetus', authorPt: 'Epicteto', authorEs: 'Epicteto',
      textEn: 'If you wish to be a writer, write. If you wish to be a philosopher, philosophize. But know this: every role you assume demands that you sacrifice all the roles you might have been. The freedom to choose is also the burden of renouncing, and the person who tries to be everything becomes nothing.',
