      authorEn: 'Epictetus', authorPt: 'Epicteto', authorEs: 'Epicteto',
      textEn: 'If the problem has a solution, we should not worry about it. And if it has no solution, worrying is pointless. Either way, worry is useless. The energy spent anticipating misfortune would be far better invested in cultivating the inner calm needed to face whatever actually arrives.',
      textPt: 'Se o problema possui solu\u00E7\u00E3o n\u00E3o devemos nos preocupar com ele. E se n\u00E3o possui solu\u00E7\u00E3o, de nada adianta nos preocuparmos. De qualquer forma a preocupa\u00E7\u00E3o \u00E9 in\u00FAtil. A energia gasta antecipando infort\u00FAnios seria muito melhor investida em cultivar a calma interior necess\u00E1ria para enfrentar o que quer que realmente chegue.',
