      authorEn: 'John Dewey', authorPt: 'John Dewey', authorEs: 'John Dewey',
      textEn: 'Education is not preparation for life; education is life itself. Every experience that genuinely engages the mind transforms the learner, and every transformation of the learner changes the world they inhabit. The separation between learning and living is the most destructive illusion of modern education.',
      textPt: 'A educa\u00E7\u00E3o n\u00E3o \u00E9 prepara\u00E7\u00E3o para a vida; a educa\u00E7\u00E3o \u00E9 a pr\u00F3pria vida. Cada experi\u00EAncia que genuinamente engaja a mente transforma o aprendiz, e cada transforma\u00E7\u00E3o do aprendiz muda o mundo que ele habita. A separa\u00E7\u00E3o entre aprender e viver \u00E9 a ilus\u00E3o mais destrutiva da educa\u00E7\u00E3o moderna.',
